    note bottom of EquipmentInstalledEvent
      <b>Dentro de Support</b>
      AppointmentRequestedEvent: si es re-evaluación, activa
      RequestReevaluationCommand.
      InstallationAssignmentCreatedEvent: activa
      MarkAppointmentScheduledCommand.
      InstallationAssignmentAttendedEvent: activa
      InstallEquipmentCommand y CompleteAppointmentCommand.
      ReevaluationAssignmentAttendedEvent: activa
      AddActuatorsCommand y CompleteAppointmentCommand.
      RequirementsNotMetEvent: activa
      MarkRequirementsNotMetCommand y
      CompleteAppointmentCommand.
      RepairAssignmentCreatedEvent: activa
      MarkTicketAssignedCommand.
      RepairAssignmentAttendedEvent: activa
      ResolveTicketCommand y, si hubo cambios,
      ReplaceEquipmentCommand.
      AppointmentExpiredEvent: activa CancelAssignmentCommand
      si la cita tiene una visita ASSIGNED; si era
      re-evaluación, CancelReevaluationCommand; si no,
      SetSchedulingDeadlineCommand.
      AppointmentCanceledEvent y TicketClosedEvent: activan
      CancelAssignmentCommand si hay visita ASSIGNED.
      InstallationServiceEndedEvent: activa
      CancelAppointmentCommand (cita activa) y
      CloseTicketCommand (tickets OPEN o ASSIGNED).
      RemovalAssignmentAttendedEvent: activa
      CompleteRemovalCommand.
      --
      <b>Hacia otros contextos</b> (application, por ACL)
      EquipmentInstalledEvent: Assets
      CreateDeviceNetworkCommand con los equipos.
      ActuatorsAddedEvent: Assets AddDeviceToNetworkCommand
      por cada actuador (red de
      GetDeviceNetworkByInstallationIdQuery).
      EquipmentReplacedEvent: Assets ChangeEdgeStatusCommand
      o ChangeDeviceStatusCommand con BROKEN para el viejo
      (lo retira de la red) y luego AddEdgeToNetworkCommand
      o AddDeviceToNetworkCommand con el nuevo.
      InstallationRejectedEvent e InstallationCanceledEvent:
      Subscriptions devuelve el pago
      (RefundSubscriptionCommand) y Communication avisa al
      familiar por correo y en la app.
      InstallationServiceEndedEvent: Assets
      DeactivateDeviceNetworkCommand (se apaga todo).
      EquipmentRemovedEvent: Assets
      DismantleDeviceNetworkCommand (libera los equipos).
      InstallationAssignmentCreatedEvent,
      RepairAssignmentCreatedEvent,
      RemovalAssignmentCreatedEvent y
      AssignmentReassignedEvent: Communication avisa al
      técnico asignado (ASSIGNMENT_CREATED).
      --
      <b>Desde otros contextos</b>
      SubscriptionCanceledEvent (Subscriptions): activa
      EndInstallationServiceCommand.
      La credencial de cada edge nace al registrarlo en
      Assets; Support no la maneja.
    end note
  }

